{"schema_version":1,"status":"partial","epoch":"zhcn-67f8551f7780","task_id":"batch-01507-s01","batch":1507,"shard":1,"source_commit":"67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835","source_queue_git_commit":"ba3815ed06a2a9bb3fddb38a6e1ea7ca64506da2","shard_start":20,"shard_end_exclusive":40,"translated_count":15,"entries":[{"entry_index":20,"uid":"zhcn:a9ea172388b275cf5f1d2a09","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"嗯……！","source_fingerprint":"65376b8a86e35a0752a2faa889379d09ec563657e83fcdf098797820fd01d8ec","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1118","140015"],"target_text":"Ừm…!","reviewed":true},{"entry_index":21,"uid":"zhcn:8d23549bd04e3bb9582a8080","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"这是在浪费时间哦。","source_fingerprint":"f75498803596c973f4e0fc758f8277ad98ca9ebecaa197b897c899dc305f97c4","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1118","140016"],"target_text":"Thế này chỉ đang lãng phí thời gian thôi.","reviewed":true},{"entry_index":22,"uid":"zhcn:46e315ab394ed77b9aab2e4d","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"真是的……","source_fingerprint":"2e024616ec7a2bf1c748a0e016d56f11053ca841cb2a9d941ddb2fa396dd0aba","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1118","140017"],"target_text":"Thật tình…","reviewed":true},{"entry_index":23,"uid":"zhcn:91a420ee14118ff28d656961","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"啊，分开了……","source_fingerprint":"6271bd2355eee651f0ebd6e2adc7edfe9b81c5ccbd86d6d4f500645c7d1bb372","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1118","140018"],"target_text":"A, tách ra rồi…","reviewed":true},{"entry_index":24,"uid":"zhcn:52ea8ef733afecec51a3badf","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"明天的是这个。","source_fingerprint":"4b6911b60c85f9b0fde1828d6077e7fd57595f123fb7ffd3267bcfcec39fbae9","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1118","15"],"target_text":"Ngày mai là cái này.","reviewed":true},{"entry_index":25,"uid":"zhcn:3ff736c9d73c7666f75cc327","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"……唔，怎么了……\r\n请开始吧……不把自己逼到绝境的话……\r\n是无法变强的……！","source_fingerprint":"60a9b92b00fd13d0b960fe3f3e2267fe6143e8b6543427cba47a389f3a8513e6","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1118","20000"],"target_text":"…Ư, sao thế…\r\nBắt đầu đi… nếu không ép mình tới đường cùng…\r\nthì sẽ không thể mạnh lên được…!","reviewed":true},{"entry_index":26,"uid":"zhcn:4ee90a8e80a86c7104087d74","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"……已经习惯了。\r\n这点程度……我能承受。\r\n……没问题。","source_fingerprint":"d6d1a11069ef0637331630fbafea9c7b5993218631dd399759334d84e6e56d98","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1118","20001"],"target_text":"…Tôi quen rồi.\r\nMức này… tôi chịu được.\r\n…Không sao.","reviewed":true},{"entry_index":27,"uid":"zhcn:40f7f16edfd1372b785492ea","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"比任何人都要强，向着更高处——\n如果是我的话，\n正因为是我才能到达。","source_fingerprint":"dadd9696f44f312507025938bf7ff12d7cd38485a6be4c040aee40710bbbe548","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1118","20002"],"target_text":"Mạnh hơn bất kỳ ai, hướng tới nơi cao hơn—\nNếu là tôi,\nchính vì là tôi nên nhất định có thể chạm tới.","reviewed":true},{"entry_index":28,"uid":"zhcn:fce02e05f94797f6db9a7730","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"……我很集中。\r\n集中到一切都能清晰地感觉到。","source_fingerprint":"d58bff96587eb37bce86eb18e3d67f3ad0239130e3de6315f7cf48dba1ab1645","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1118","20003"],"target_text":"…Tôi đang rất tập trung.\r\nTập trung tới mức có thể cảm nhận rõ mọi thứ.","reviewed":true},{"entry_index":29,"uid":"zhcn:34addcf13c6246cfd2c19ebf","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"……鞋带，松了哦。\r\n……看你好像没注意到的样子。","source_fingerprint":"a478de9ec30f42414783d7f28e9088d57a51f70ee082bbb149a88d725f550b7f","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1118","20004"],"target_text":"…Dây giày của anh bị lỏng rồi.\r\n…Trông anh có vẻ chưa nhận ra.","reviewed":true},{"entry_index":30,"uid":"zhcn:c9b5ade5b4e0d4d27471ccaf","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"桌上的训练用品\r\n目录里，我已经贴好标签了。\r\n请您过目考虑。","source_fingerprint":"620ae6a486f66449d1d125bc3817a0f395a5e087c9118fc2592833f74592c488","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1118","20005"],"target_text":"Trong catalog dụng cụ tập luyện trên bàn,\r\ntôi đã đánh dấu sẵn rồi.\r\nAnh hãy xem qua và cân nhắc.","reviewed":true},{"entry_index":31,"uid":"zhcn:b8732c2f13d4fa955bf60dd4","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"……在开始之前，我可以听会儿音乐\r\n吗？我想集中精神。","source_fingerprint":"0c360cdf7df535cc5c25deff6a92d949db2c0a313a46a4902e7d2c880b0eec8a","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1118","20006"],"target_text":"…Trước khi bắt đầu, tôi nghe nhạc một lúc\r\nđược không? Tôi muốn tập trung tinh thần.","reviewed":true},{"entry_index":32,"uid":"zhcn:d3afe2759b534f9b3f99aff8","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"……爱如往昔同学。\r\n……！","source_fingerprint":"a9e12a0e30417b6413685ac6da0bfd9c563b9f643d4bdc6cc8760183eb3b996d","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1118","20007"],"target_text":"…Still in Love.\r\n…!","reviewed":true},{"entry_index":33,"uid":"zhcn:ca97229b85bd7996ff8ab1b5","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"不需要，您的关心……\r\n现在，请别跟我说话……\r\n我想，集中精神。","source_fingerprint":"65557b3d65b9e16acad9911eb239f981cc70ce2bd1ad7924ae1826004f9a2443","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1118","20008"],"target_text":"Tôi không cần anh quan tâm…\r\nBây giờ, xin đừng nói chuyện với tôi…\r\nTôi muốn tập trung.","reviewed":true},{"entry_index":34,"uid":"zhcn:f37a3e4e649f1d4141924f19","kind":"character_system_text","source_text":"请离我远点。\r\n……为了彼此好，请离开……","source_fingerprint":"12b0d73104e50fe9d67e0f6fe6786e42f79ab6bb8978929bd7e139c6904e8172","source_path":"character_system_text_dict.json","json_path":["1118","20009"],"target_text":"Xin hãy tránh xa tôi.\r\n…Vì tốt cho cả hai, xin hãy rời đi…","reviewed":true}]}